    {
      "id": "practice.intro.hormesis-two.1",
      "script": "This Hormesis practice has 2 rounds. Stay seated or lying down somewhere safe. Never practice standing, walking, driving, or in water. Stop for dizziness or discomfort. In each round, follow 30 breaths, 2 seconds in and 2 seconds out. A short chime marks the final breath: 4 seconds in, then 6 seconds out. Afterward, pause only while comfortable, for up to 60 seconds. Release whenever you need to. There is no need to reach the count. The final 5 seconds are spoken. Then follow the recovery: breathe in for 4, hold comfortably for up to 15, breathe out for 6, and settle. After the second recovery, let your breath return naturally.",
      "maxSeconds": 89.75,
      "assetId": "practice.intro.hormesis-two.1",
